{"id":"n25517-2-5","stage":3,"title":"곧잘 · 时常","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25517-2-5-1","ko":"우리 커피 마시러 어디로 갈래?","zh":"我们要去哪儿喝咖啡呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커피","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마시러","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈래?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7